Reportedly Rassimov's deadliest power, few have survived this attack. However, both [[Lok Lambert]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] survived being attacked by [[Rassimov]]'s Bladestorm spell and thus number among its few survivors. {{source|TCG:SAS-129|SAS-129}}

Rassimov used this power against [[Dante Vale]] as part of his numerous traps set up at [[The Professor's castle|the Professor's castle]]. Both Dante and Rassimov fought one another using a blade from the power, with Rassimov using [[Firebrand]] to halve the blade into two with a dangerous lit end. {{source|The Divine Comedy}}

